<div style="padding:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;max-width:640px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Shiny Docking</h3>
    <p>
        A Visual-Studio-style docking host for Blazor. Layouts are a serializable tree of
        splits and tab groups arranged around a document area, with tool-window rails on
        any edge.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Declarative <code>DockRoot</code> layout, JSON serializable</li>
        <li>Panels registered through DI with <code>AddDockPanel&lt;T&gt;()</code></li>
        <li>Show / hide / activate / reset via <code>IDockHost</code></li>
    </ul>
</div>
